{%- comment -%}
  Age gate — two arms, one experiment.

  Arm A (control): a single yes/no tap, remembered for `age_gate_remember_days`.
  Arm B (challenger): the date-of-birth form that is the category default —
  three numeric fields, "Confirm & Enter", and a hard stop for anyone under age.

  Arm B exists so the friction can be *measured* rather than argued about, and
  it is deliberately the plain industry form rather than a nicer one — the point
  is to measure what the category already does, not a redesign of it.
  `age_gate_min_age` is a single number because this site is US-only; a country
  lookup would change what the test measures (region blocking, not form friction)
  without changing what US visitors experience.

  Which arm renders is decided by `data-ab-age_gate` on <html>, stamped by
  ab-framework.liquid before first paint. That attribute drives BOTH the CSS
  below and the JS in theme.js, so the two can never disagree about which arm
  is live. With the experiment absent or parked, arm A renders — the safe
  default is always the low-friction gate.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  No `hidden` attribute. The gate is visible by default and is taken away by
  `data-age="ok"` — see age-gate-head.liquid. Shipping it hidden meant the site
  painted first and the gate arrived afterwards, if at all.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="age-gate" id="age-gate" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
     aria-label="Age verification">
  <div class="age-gate__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <noscript>
    <div class="age-gate__panel">
      <div class="age-gate__inner">
        <div class="age-gate__wordmark">Nine Below</div>
        <h1 class="age-gate__heading">{{ settings.age_gate_heading }}</h1>
        <p class="age-gate__legal">
          Confirming your age needs JavaScript, which is turned off in this
          browser. Please enable it and reload.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </noscript>

  <div class="age-gate__panel">

    {%- comment -%} ---------- Arm A — one tap ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="age-gate__arm" data-gate-arm="a">
      <div class="age-gate__inner" data-gate-step="ask">
        {%- if settings.logo != blank -%}
          <img class="age-gate__logo"
               src="{{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 420 }}"
               alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}" width="210" height="auto">
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="age-gate__wordmark">Nine Below</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <h1 class="age-gate__heading" id="age-gate-heading-a">
          {{ settings.age_gate_heading }}
        </h1>

        <div class="age-gate__actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-gate-confirm>Yes</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-gate-deny>No</button>
        </div>

        <p class="age-gate__legal">
          By entering you agree to our
          <a href="/pages/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a> and
          <a href="/pages/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="age-gate__inner age-gate__inner--deny" data-gate-step="deny" hidden>
        <h2 class="age-gate__heading">{{ settings.age_gate_deny_text }}</h2>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-gate-back>Go back</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ---------- Arm B — date of birth ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="age-gate__arm" data-gate-arm="b">
      <div class="age-gate__inner" data-gate-step="ask">
        {%- if settings.logo != blank -%}
          <img class="age-gate__logo"
               src="{{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 420 }}"
               alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}" width="210" height="auto">
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="age-gate__wordmark">Nine Below</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if settings.age_gate_dob_eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="age-gate__eyebrow">{{ settings.age_gate_dob_eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <h1 class="age-gate__heading" id="age-gate-heading-b">
          {{ settings.age_gate_dob_heading }}
        </h1>

        {%- comment -%}
          novalidate: the browser's own bubble would fire before the script can
          count the age, so the visitor would see two different error styles for
          two different failures. One error surface, one voice.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <form class="dob" data-gate-form autocomplete="off" novalidate>
          <div class="dob__fields">
            <label class="dob__field">
              <span class="dob__label">Month</span>
              <input class="dob__input" data-gate-mm type="text" inputmode="numeric"
                     pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="2" placeholder="MM"
                     aria-label="Birth month" required>
            </label>
            <label class="dob__field">
              <span class="dob__label">Day</span>
              <input class="dob__input" data-gate-dd type="text" inputmode="numeric"
                     pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="2" placeholder="DD"
                     aria-label="Birth day" required>
            </label>
            <label class="dob__field">
              <span class="dob__label">Birth year</span>
              <input class="dob__input" data-gate-yyyy type="text" inputmode="numeric"
                     pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="4" placeholder="YYYY"
                     aria-label="Birth year" required>
            </label>
          </div>

          <p class="dob__error" data-gate-error role="alert" hidden></p>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--block">
            {{ settings.age_gate_dob_cta }}
          </button>
        </form>

        <p class="age-gate__legal">
          By entering you agree to our
          <a href="/pages/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a> and
          <a href="/pages/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        No "go back" here, matching the live site: a visitor who has entered a
        birthdate under the legal age is done. Arm A can offer a way back
        because a mis-tap is plausible; a typed date is a stated answer.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="age-gate__inner age-gate__inner--deny" data-gate-step="deny" hidden>
        <h2 class="age-gate__heading">{{ settings.age_gate_deny_text }}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
